## Rutas de la aplicación, en su propio módulo (como `routes/` de Express).
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## calling routes.register with sigil of app
## ```
import portus

## Responde en `GET /`.
weave home with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
    calling context.send_text with "inicio"
    return calling portus.ok_void

## Responde en `GET /about`.
weave about with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
    calling context.send_text with "acerca de"
    return calling portus.ok_void

## Registra todas las rutas de este módulo en `app`.
weave register with app as ref to portus.Application into void:
    let a as result of void to portus.PatternError is calling portus.get with app, "/", home
    let b as result of void to portus.PatternError is calling portus.get with app, "/about", about
